    "description": "<p>When the Empress makes a successful standard attack against a PC, you can <strong>spend a Fear</strong> to activate a Doom Countdown (1d6+1) for that PC. It ticks down when a PC rolls with Fear. When it triggers, the PC marks all HP and makes a death move. If the Empress is defeated or the PCs take a rest, all Doom Countdowns end.</p>",
